      "content": "Hey, I'm prepping for the quarterly audit next week and need a high-level summary of our current defensive integrity. Can you give me a rundown of our posture? Specifically, are there any known gaps or reliability issues with our scanning and monitoring tools that I need to account for before the auditors get here?",
